<p>Hi, I’m Maria, the founder of JerseyShoreScents! I often say “we,” but it’s really just me behind the scenes. I make, label, pack, and ship every product myself. JerseyShoreScents is proudly veteran owned, and I’m grateful for your patience and support when military duty calls and I need to pause the shop for a little while.</p>

<h2>How JerseyShoreScents began</h2>
<p>I grew up at the Jersey Shore, and I wanted my shop’s name to reflect where I came from and my love for fragrance. The idea started shortly after I bought my first home and was looking for a hobby. I tried candles and wax melts first. Then, somewhere in a late night scroll through Instagram and TikTok, I got the idea to make something I’d actually use every day.</p>

<h2>From candles to Whipped Body Butter</h2>
<p>I’ve always been picky about what I put on my skin, especially lotion. I started researching ingredients and testing recipes until I found a blend I loved enough to use every day. It took more batches than I can count, but that blend became our Whipped Body Butter. It’s still the heart of JerseyShoreScents.</p>

<h2>Always making something new</h2>
<p>My favorite part of this business is creating new scents. I’ve made over 70 fragrances, with plenty more ideas waiting for their turn. I love offering enough variety for you to find an everyday favorite or discover a scent you never expected to love.</p>

<p>Whether you’ve been here from the beginning or you’re just finding my shop, thank you for giving my products a chance. Your support helped turn a hobby into a business I’m proud to call mine.</p>
<p>Maria<br>Founder, JerseyShoreScents</p>
